 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Silent Witch - another - Kekkai No Majutsushi No Nariagari"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "サイレント・ウィッチ -another- 結界の魔術師の成り上がり"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lewis, who grew up in a cold village, was such a genius that he memorized all the books on magic dropped by a visitor to his village in just one week. The book was dropped by Rutherford, a teacher at Minerva, the country's top magician training institute, and one of the Seven Wise Men, the Purple Smoke Sorcerer. Rutherford discovered Lewis' talent and made him a special student at Minerva, but Lewis, with his coarse and violent personality, was a problem child at the magic school. However, Lewis, who was feared as a bad boy, met respected teachers and reliable friends and changed.\n\nThe spin-off of “Silent Witch Chinmoku no Majo no Kakushigoto” depicts the legendary Lewis in his youth, who later became famous as the “Wizard of Warding.”",
   "ja": "寒村で育ったルイスは、たまたま村に訪れた人が落とした魔術の教本を僅か一週間ですべて覚えてしまうほどの天才だった。\n教本を落としたのは国でもトップの魔術師養成機関ミネルヴァの教師で七賢人の一人＜紫煙の魔術師ラザフォード。\nラザフォードに才能を見出されミネルヴァの特待生になったルイスだったが、粗野で乱暴な性格をしているルイスは魔術学校では問題児……。\nしかし、悪童と恐れられるルイスは尊敬できる師や頼れる友人たちと出会い変わっていき―――\n\n後に＜結界の魔術師＞として名を轟かせる七賢人ルイス・ミラー、青春時代の伝説的悪行と活躍を描く『サイレント・ウィッチ』スピンオフ☆"
  },
